{"text": "On a bright street full of theaters, Soapy began to shout, dance, and sing as loudly as he could. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The policeman only turned his back and told a man that Soapy was a college student celebrating a victory. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They are noisy but harmless, he said, and we have orders to leave them alone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy stopped his useless noise in despair, wondering if he would ever reach the Island. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a cigar store, Soapy saw a well dressed man who had left his silk umbrella by the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy stepped inside, took the umbrella, and walked slowly away, and the man hurried after him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is my umbrella, said the man, and Soapy told him to call the policeman standing at the corner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The man slowed down and said that he might have picked it up by mistake in a restaurant that morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If it is yours, I hope you will excuse me, he said, and he hurried back into the cigar store. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Feeling angry, Soapy threw the umbrella into a hole in the road and complained about the police.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "a", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", "a", "t", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "S", "o", "a", "p", "y", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "t", ",", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "s", " ", "l", "o", "u", "d", "l", "y", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "l", "i", "c", "e", "m", "a", "n", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", 